//! Sounio semantic authority for Pireus Quotient Novelty Forge v5.
//!
//! The matcher-free executable was committed before the first successful
//! Sounio authority transcript. Frozen values below come only from that
//! hash-bound observation; they are not external goldens or novelty ranks.

